      "sourceLink": null,
      "spam": false,
      "statusChangeID": null,
      "value": "Seen a few people encounter this issue. Likely related to login sessions not being refreshed properly for certain vrchat server endpoints (assuming not cache related or other issues)\nWhat fixed it for them is going to the main menu and explicitly logging out, and then logging back in. \nThis should refresh your \"session\". Restarting the game does not have the same effect, as vrchat does not automatically login using your credentials as it doesn't save them, what it does save is a login session token presumably, that you get when logging in with your username and password.",
      "viewerReactions": null,
      "voteID": null
    },
